From 8ca73a9f2c6d073e73d93180348cb1b3214e4c9a Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Xiaoxiang Yang <xiaoxian@qti.qualcomm.com>
Date: Tue, 4 Aug 2026 09:15:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] ar-osal: fix audio_smmu_helper_create() no-arg signature
 mismatch

The lnx.2.0 header declares audio_smmu_helper_create() with no parameters,
but the LY platform source calls it with NULL (lnx.1.0 style). GCC 15
(C23 default) makes this a hard error.

Source: QLI-2.0-AUTO reference port.

Upstream-Status: Inappropriate [porting - bridging lnx.1.0/lnx.2.0 API divergence]

Change-Id: Ide7650985a82b55323488cdebd21305dcb940b40
Signed-off-by: Xiaoxiang Yang <xiaoxian@qti.qualcomm.com>
---
 platform/ly/src/ar_osal_shmem.c | 4 ++--
 1 file changed, 2 insertions(+), 2 deletions(-)

diff --git a/platform/ly/src/ar_osal_shmem.c b/platform/ly/src/ar_osal_shmem.c
index 889e90b..27bb7d2 100644
--- a/platform/ly/src/ar_osal_shmem.c
+++ b/platform/ly/src/ar_osal_shmem.c
@@ -227,7 +227,7 @@ int32_t ar_shmem_alloc(_Inout_ ar_shmem_info *info)
   {
     total_size = (info->buf_size + AR_OSAL_SHMEM_ALIGNMENT - 1)&~(AR_OSAL_SHMEM_ALIGNMENT - 1);
 
-    asmmu = audio_smmu_helper_create(NULL);
+    asmmu = audio_smmu_helper_create();
     if (asmmu == NULL)
     {
       AR_LOG_ERR(AR_OSAL_SHMEM_LOG_TAG, "audio_smmu_helper_create failed");
@@ -408,7 +408,7 @@ int32_t ar_shmem_map(_Inout_ ar_shmem_info *info)
      *and pass it on to the audio smmu helper.
      */
 
-    asmmu = audio_smmu_helper_create(NULL);
+    asmmu = audio_smmu_helper_create();
     if (asmmu == NULL)
     {
       AR_LOG_ERR(AR_OSAL_SHMEM_LOG_TAG, "audio_smmu_helper_create failed");
-- 
2.34.1

